      48.02,
      473.87,
      286.84,
      537.81
    ],
    "text": "My Ref. No. : \u0db8\u0dc4/\u0d89/\u0d85\u0dad\u0dca/378. I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the following lands which is required for a public purpose.",
