      "Iskoola Pota",
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.02,
      537.47,
      286.59,
      654.11
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired : Lot Nos. 01 and 02 in Sheet No. 01 of Ward No. 03 in the Cadastral Map 521416 in extent of 1.9266 Hectares prepared by the Surveyor General situated within the Grama Niladhari Division of 496 Kottawa South in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Maharagama in the Colombo District, Western Province and described as follows :",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold",
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973
    ]
