    "bbox": [
      302.35,
      532.67,
      541.62,
      607.31
    ],
    "text": "Furthermore, hereby requested to notify me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 22nd October, 2025, the nature of their interests in the land/lands, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of the compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
